{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-10-1-4:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_10_1_4\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_4:p1\",\"text\":\"本节明确本试验AE与SAE收集期。AE收集期自首次给予试验用药品开始，至末次给药后30天结束；SAE收集期自受试者签署知情同意书开始，至末次给药后30天结束。若受试者提前终止试验，AE和SAE均收集至提前终止访视后30天。上述30天为本试验项目化的收集截止定义，不应作为其他试验的通用截断。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_4:p2\",\"text\":\"收集起点参考事件按AE与SAE分别界定：AE以首次给予试验用药品为收集起点，SAE以受试者签署知情同意书为收集起点。签署知情同意书后至首次给药前发生的事件属于给药前事件，应记录SAE并按法规报告，但不计入TEAE；签署知情同意书前发生的事件不作为研究AE收集。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_4:p3\",\"text\":\"AE收集不预先限定为TEAE。在收集期内发生的所有AE均应记录，后续再按TEAE或非TEAE进行分类；因此，AE收集范围不等于TEAE归类，两者不得混同。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"d4950ec961040e02f99d8972a27a4dbea5b429e975ce2b68d68a7ca3bcc5d3a3"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:28c5510557c1b27f6320d2405e51bf36b9783520a0e25b6e5636e80f4f696f94:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:28c5510557c1b27f6320d2405e51bf36b9783520a0e25b6e5636e80f4f696f94:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"74f6bc817bf3a07e9724828cfb361717e3bed3546c2591e36af69e4700212a3b","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"09219475-70c1-46a9-b2a5-1a67f3d5feb9","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}